It is strongly recommended that Amazon stop using EMS!
The product is five stars, the logistics is one star, and the average is three stars.
I don't understand why amazon wants to send EMS. It is not reliable, which is acknowledged by the industry. Well, computers are expensive items, after all!
The order was placed after the purchase, and it was estimated to be delivered on the 20th. The family waited at home for three days!
Why does it take four or five days to send from Xiamen to Fuzhou?
On Tuesday morning, I finally checked my logistics and found out that it arrived in Fuzhou. I was so excited to open and receive it! However, when I went to check the logistics again at night, there were no calls or messages from anyone. To my surprise, the package had already been signed for by someone else in the afternoon!
I was shocked at that moment!
Who am I? Where am I? Is this computer really mine?
I'm starting to doubt the existence of life itself!
I finally ran to the drop-off point to bring back the computer.
The specific reason is simple, because the express delivery guy mixed up the two numbers, but fortunately, the package was not lost.
I strongly suggest Amazon not to use EMS anymore. In the future, if Amazon uses EMS to send express delivery, I will definitely not buy it again.
