The outer packaging is damaged quite seriously, and the packaging box inside seems to be new, but the manual seems to be not new, as it was installed in September, and I hope that the product will not be bad when I receive it, please explain to Amazon why so many customers mentioned the damaged packaging, but you can still be at ease, thank you!
The goods are good, but the platform is still bureaucratic.
The hard drive is of very good quality and has an excellent price-performance ratio. It is cheaper than buying one in Hong Kong. If you can tolerate the shipping time, I would definitely recommend buying one.
But I have to say that Amazon's bureaucracy is still the same as a few years ago when I swore I would never use it. You can never find out the actual logistics status. Information is always delivered after a few weeks, you can never complain, and it's so bureaucratic!
The goods will be delivered in a few days, and the logistics information is that you will receive the goods 10 days later!
Excited beyond expectations
I really didn't have any confidence before I bought it, but I felt it was right when I opened the package!
Finally, when I touched the earphone wire, it felt particularly soft and of high quality. I couldn't wait to plug it into my phone and open QQ Music.
I was shocked, the sound quality was 3D surround!
I asked the price in the physical store, it was about 30 yuan, but it was not the branded product, it was a random brand, so I said that this Pisen product is worth having, although it is 27 yuan, but the value is absolutely worth it!
Logistics is too slow.
Showed up on October 16th, and the result was only received on October 21st, bad review!
The delivery is too slow, and it's already slow to buy things on Amazon. I didn't expect it to be this slow!
Incorrect image
I thought I could receive the earphone in the picture 1, but I received the one in the picture 2. It's okay if the pictures are inconsistent. What does it mean that the left and right earphones have different volume levels?
Although the names are the same, I still hope that everyone can pay attention to it carefully, and the Amazon responsible person can change the correct picture in time. Thank you very much.
The sleeves that are incomprehensible to people.
It's said to be made of cowhide, and it's indeed quite hard, but if you look closely, there are many small cracks on it, and it's not clear whether it's real leather. Besides, the sleeves of this coat are really incomprehensible; the sleeves of a jacket are usually a little longer than the length of the jacket, but usually only 1-2 cm; this coat is 5 cm long, and the arms naturally hang down to the position of the paw of the tiger, but the sleeves of this coat cover the fingers.
It's a Y-shaped crossbeam!
The product is not a scam. The product is a horizontal bar, but it is shown as a vertical bar on Amazon images.
The worst online shopping experience
After placing the order on September 28, the system showed that the goods had been shipped, but I did not receive the goods until October 12.
I want to inquire about the status of my order on Amazon, but the seller didn't provide the tracking number, so I can't find out where my order is.
So I sent an email to the seller asking if they could provide me with the tracking number, but I didn't get a reply for two days.
In desperation, I called Amazon customer service and they told me the seller's phone number. After calling the store again several times, the line was connected and I was informed that the package had been lost. They said I could immediately have another one sent to me.
Although I was particularly angry, I didn't say much to the seller because I urgently needed the computer. I just wanted to send it to me as soon as possible.
The result is that I called the next day to ask if the shipment had been sent.
The seller said it hasn't arrived yet and it will be sent in the afternoon.
I called again in the afternoon and the seller said it would be sent, and it would be sent after 5 or 6 o'clock in the afternoon. However, when I called again at 7 o'clock in the evening, the phone was not answered.
The next morning, I called again to check if the goods had been shipped.
Can you tell me the order number?
The seller said that he didn't send it, and told me to order from other places if I was in a hurry, but if I could wait until the afternoon, he would send it.
There’s no way, I have to wait for a long time to order from other places.
I can only ask the seller to send it quickly.
Finally, after countless phone calls, I received my computer on October 16.
As for the quality of the computer, I don't know because it was bought for someone else, so I will add a comment later.
Fake goods, especially good ones.
Amazon sells fake goods, and I was fooled.
Customer service said that since it was used, it cannot be returned, and I didn't use it, so I don't know if it's fake.
Because of trust, I was sad; after all, it is a makeup product. Please go to a real store and buy it. I appreciate it.
Because it is a flash sale, I did not read the comments. I have submitted the e-commerce platform to the State Administration for Market Regulation. Let’s fight for our rights together.
The experience of being sad
I previously bought a filter cartridge for online shopping and the filtering effect is good. I can use it for another day or two after 28 days and there is still no lime scale.
Because the quality of the things I bought on Amazon has always been good, I wanted to buy it here this time. This is the first time I bought a filter on Amazon. I feel that the quality is not very good. Not only did it start to form water residue early, but the filter was also used until the 28th day, and there were suspended black carbon powder. I don't know whether to continue using it or throw it away. I am very frustrated.
The discount is very reasonable after the discount, and the Amazon fake discount is very sad.
Strong insulation for the baby born one week ago.
The outside of the teapot can't feel any heat, and it can effectively protect the temperature from leaking out, so it won't hurt people even if they touch it.
The air conditioning in the room remained on high all night.
Amazon said that the 320th anniversary of the event was a big discount, but later found that everyone had 249,289,299, and felt cheated, but when I went to the supermarket to compare, I found that it was more cost-effective than various brands at the same price, so I could take it with me when I went out.
The purchase was not very satisfactory this time
This is the second time I bought a Pampers from Amazon. I bought a box of Pampers when my baby was 2 months old. I chose the European import paper for the diapers, and the first experience was quite satisfactory. The baby used one diaper all night, which is really enough for 12 hours.
But this time, I bought L-type diapers, and there were 2 packages in one box. When I opened it, I found that the paper was quite loose, and there was a clear difference with the imported Pampers. After using it for my baby, it was still okay, and there was no urine leakage and no signs of rashes.
But when the second package of diapers was used, the baby's inner thighs immediately appeared red rashes, which have not disappeared yet.
I suspect the quality of the two packages in one box is not the same.
I will not buy it again in the future!
Please Amazon strictly review the suspected counterfeit products
The quality is terrible, the packaging is loose and has no weight, it is not even better than the products on the roadside stall, there is no net weight, no bar code, and the packaging of ten bags is loose, which is not the characteristic of qualified products; it is the worst shopping experience on Amazon, and I have applied for a refund; it is completely a quality problem; I suggest the merchant wake up and refuse to sell poor quality products; addition: I also bought the heart-shaped stamp, 23 yuan / 10 sheets in the supermarket, and added a few pictures for comparison, further verifying the poor quality of this product, in order to give consumers a more clear reference, avoid economic losses and further unhappiness!
Once again, we hope that Amazon can be meticulous and strict with the source of the products.
The adhesive of the label is too weak and it is not waterproof.
Although the Bluetooth connection is convenient, the printed content is not waterproof, and the surface is not covered with a film; and the adhesive of the label is poor, it is not suitable for cable labeling at all, and it is very easy to fall off, so friends who buy it to organize cables need to pay attention.
The machine is new, and the shopping experience is good.
I looked at it on Christmas, and it was more expensive than 150 yuan, but the delivery was a bit slow.
The machine is pretty good; they're all new.
The built-in Pikachu.
Then if you connect the ball to the Dream, you will receive a Dream.
It's fun to play, and it has better portability than PS4.
I already bought The Legend of Zelda; I'll wait for the game and try it out next time.
The value for money is very high.
It has been used 3-4 times already.
1. The package is in good condition.
2. It is very simple to use and easy to clean.
3、 It is completely possible to do a haircut yourself and save money.
All in all, a very successful purchase.
The toy is of good quality, and I have to complain about the packaging.
I received the package yesterday, which was sent by Amazon and marked EMS. The last one was delivered by Tmall's express. How many bends did it take? Is the relationship between Amazon and Tmall still good?
As for the packaging, it is wrapped with several layers of fresh-keeping film. There is not even a piece of plastic foam inside. When you open it, all the parts are in an empty box. Fortunately, the toy quality is good, and there are no broken parts. However, it is too small compared to what I imagined. Because it is not battery-operated, the hand-pushed toy often derails. I feel that the gap between the tracks on both sides is too large, and the design is unreasonable.
The goods are good.
First, I bought it a few days ago and found that it was reduced in price. The review is bad, but the product is still not bad, it has a good price-performance ratio, the CPU and graphics card are enough to cope with mainstream online games and a considerable part of large single-player games, the heat dissipation is very good, but the screen is a little light leakage (common disease of ips screen), the sound quality is not good, and the hard drive is not good (it is recommended to spend some money to add a solid state drive), and yesterday I took it to the after-sales testing of the hardware, there is no problem at all, the pre-installed win8.1 is not good to use, it is recommended to upgrade to 10, the seller sent the goods very quickly, and the answers to various inquiries were also very quick, the invoice arrived the next day after receiving the computer, it is not bad, but unfortunately there is no gift.
(I would like to add that when buying a keyboard cover, do not buy it from a shop called E cool Digital Center on Tmall. The delivery is slow, the quality is bad, and the product is not returned or exchanged if there is a problem. The boss also talks a lot of dirty words. I would like to expose it specially)
You dirty rotten scoundrels.
I bought it and it was said on the activity page that the gift of the "Three Body Problem" would be given when the total amount is 99 yuan. But I didn't get the gift. When I called the customer service, they asked me to show the screenshot of the activity at that time. The problem is that who buys things would save the webpage screenshot. You need customers to help you provide the evidence of your own activity. Please be careful next time and save the evidence.
I want to tell everyone not to waste money.
First, I was looking forward to buying and thought that the DaoLe products would not be bad. After receiving it, I thought the packaging was still good, the size was not bad, but there was basically one box that was soft, which could not be seen from the outside, and I needed to feel it with my hands. When I ate it, there was no taste at all, it was tasteless and had no flavor, and when I bit it open, the fruit was dark yellow, which meant it was bad, and the price was not cheap, and the quality was too bad! I advise you not to buy it.
I will not buy fruits from e-commerce again after learning from this experience!
The picture quality is really unacceptable
As a title of “Ancient Map Collection”, the book is really hard to accept in terms of the selection of pictures, layout, and printing, and some pictures are even pixelated and blurred to the point of being unrecognizable.
Even if this book is not a professional atlas, even if it is a small-sized illustration, it should be worthy of the abundant ancient Chinese materials left by our ancestors in the index!
And, after all, many of the images are available from the relevant industry resources in a clear original file, so what is the difference between using an image and not using an image?
I am sorry for this kind of academic spirit.
On matters of writing, no opinion is offered; each has his own discernment.
Overall 2 stars.
Good shopping
East and West both highly recommend!
I still believe in Amazon's self-owned things. After shopping overseas, it is very convenient. The logistics time of returning the goods from abroad is also a few days longer than the domestic logistics. It must be said that Amazon's ability to clear customs in China is very strong. It is much faster than going through a transshipment. So now many things are bought overseas on Amazon.
I hope the quality and price of domestic products will be better, and many things are made in China, but when we go out and buy them back, they are cheaper than in China, so I hope they will improve.
To have bought something that has been opened before
It is indeed expensive to pay taxes of more than three hundred for a machine that costs more than one hundred. I feel more comfortable now that I will pay more than six hundred.
The seal was broken when I received it, and it looked like it had been opened before, so I took a picture of it right away. It turned out that the seal was opened, and the paperboard inside was damaged. I was worried that it was returned by someone else, and I didn't want to wait until the anniversary to try it out. Fortunately, the machine didn't have any electricity, and there was no hair in the blade. Otherwise, I would have to go a long way to return it!
It is not known whether it is good or not, or whether there will be any problems in the short term. The previous evaluation is that the goods sent out when there is a shortage are not reliable!
Overall satisfied
I was worried about the packaging of the camera at first, but this time it was good. There was an inflatable package inside, and the camera was consistent with the three codes. It can also be registered on the official website. The shutter speed is 0, and the rest can only wait for the time to test it.
The delivery speed is pretty fast. Here I complain about the courier: expensive items are placed in the lobby, and he is so fast that I can’t check the package in front of him. It’s really ridiculous.
It is too small, there is no umbrella cover, and the material is not good.
It's not a big deal at all!
The second Totes, 1. It doesn't have a cover 2. The material of the handle is normal 3. It is written as Large, but it is actually a convenient umbrella for one person, and two people will probably find it uncomfortable.
And before in America I bought that one that can be used by three people without any pressure.
The product is good, but Amazon's after-sales service is really worse than other websites
I placed an order and found out that I made a mistake. However, I can't cancel the order. The webpage contacted the online customer service, but it always shows an error link and I can't contact them.
After delivery, the delivery person called me and said I didn't want it anymore; I wanted to cancel the order but it wasn't successful. The delivery person took it back and said they would sign for it first so that I could apply for a return.
When applying for a return, I was informed that food items cannot be returned once signed for, and I couldn't call Amazon customer service, and they said the same thing, that food items cannot be returned once signed for.
I have bought non-returnable items on JD.com and Suning before, including milk and diapers, and contacted the customer service to get them returned. The diapers opened after they were delivered smelled too bad, but the customer service still gave me a refund. On Amazon, you can't get a refund for non-returnable items.
The rules are dead, people are alive, how should we handle this? Contact our customer service department.
Either I take it myself or I let the delivery person buy it, the delivery person is already hard enough, why should I make them spend money to buy something that is not theirs?
Okay, I won't back out either. I'll take it myself, but I have to give your service a 1
The earphone has a distortion and there is a background noise
This headphone is really trash, I don't know if it's my ears that are the problem or if this headphone really isn't as good as it used to be.
I bought a blue one two years ago on a certain Taobao, the sound quality is not bad, there is no noise and the bass is good, I used it for more than two years and it broke down, so I want to buy another one (urbeats). After all, I feel it is not bad.
I bought a purple one, which is quite good looking, but when I opened it today, I found that the sound was not right. The sound was either too loud or too soft.
At first, I thought it was the song's sound effects that caused this, but after listening for a while, I found that the problem was very serious. Not only was the sound out of tune, but the low-frequency effect was also not as good as before, and there was some noise mixed in, which only the purple one I bought had this problem, or is the current earphone manufacturing technology really not good?
A very poor rating, I'm very disappointed.
I definitely have to return the goods tomorrow.
PS looks good.
Amazon should not sell such products
Buy it when it is on sale, the price is not low, and the comments are also very good.
When I actually received the product, I was shocked. The product was scratched all over, and there were scratches on other parts of the product. It was not a defective product or a second-hand product. I will post a picture later.
I applied for a return, and the factory said that it was the transportation that caused it, is this not nonsense?
How can the goods be worn out inside?
There are only two possibilities: either it is a defective or a used product, or I deliberately damaged the product and then returned it.
Objectively, I have no evidence to prove that I didn't damage the goods, but based on my shopping record on Amazon, I think such goods shouldn't appear in Amazon's self-sold goods. Customers choose Amazon's self-sold goods with trust, customer win, we win, customers' victory is the victory of manufacturers, and I hope everyone can work together to improve, thank you.
Very satisfied with the watch.
It must be genuine. I checked it in the special store. The appearance of the watch is beautiful, the workmanship is exquisite, the material is sufficient, and it is also an imported mechanical movement. Therefore, it has a certain weight. It is not comparable to the so-called mechanical watches of three or four hundred. This is a genuine product.
The watch is very accurate, the error is completely within the acceptable range. The packaging of the watch comes with a jewelry certification. The 12 words on the dial are real diamonds. It is suitable to wear yourself, and it is also very faceable to send it as a gift.
Bentley is indeed good.
It's good on both sides.
The goods are really good, and I sent it to my girlfriend. However, it was a bit unpleasant when the courier didn't deliver the package during noon when I was not in Canada. The logistics company directly put the package in the parcel locker and didn't send me a verification message to pick up the package. I had to run two times.
However, the baby is really good.
Authentic product, please take good care of the packaging.
The packaging is complete, and there is an inflatable bag inside. There is only a picture of a product that looks shabby online.
The plastic film on the outside of the bottle was the same as the one described in the picture, and the delivery was also fast. It arrived the day after I ordered it.
It is genuine, but it is out of stock and I don’t know when it will be back in stock.
It looks beautiful.
I have been eyeing this camera for a long time, but I did not buy it because of some other reasons besides the price, so I bought it this time because the price was still acceptable and I could get free shipping.
After buying it, there was no problem with the rest, but when connecting the software, it couldn't be connected at all. My family is TP router, and after searching online, I found that many people had this problem. I spent more than two hours changing the settings of the router, and finally I used 360WIFI as a medium to solve it. In the meantime, I called the customer service of Xiaomi, and they didn't have any solutions for this problem. They directly told me to contact Amazon for after-sales service.
Another thing worth noting is that I saw users’ comments on the Internet saying that the camera supports a minimum of 8G storage card, and the storage capacity is smaller, it cannot be identified, so please pay attention to this.
It's okay to use, the picture is acceptable, but the sound quality is poor, and the machine has a certain degree of heating, and if it is turned on all the time, it feels a little unacceptable.
In summary, this product has many shortcomings, and I hope everyone will be careful when buying it.
Lightweight and large capacity
I like it lightweight, with a big opening, but I think the two independent separable bags are a bit redundant for me, and I don't know what to put in them.
After I bought it, I found that there was another one with a similar brand name on the overseas shopping website. It was only about RMB 200.
Amazon shipping issues
After receiving the goods, the following was found:
1. The table packaging is severely damaged.
2. The table of contents is seriously misformatted.
3. The clock does not go, the desk lamp cannot be charged, and the time cannot be adjusted.
4. Contact Amazon customer service separately, and you can only send it to the US at your own expense, and then pay for the postage.
5. The reason for getting two stars is that customer service was good.
The first time I bought it, the product had problems, all the lights were flashing and couldn't be used.
I asked for a refund, but the goods have been delivered to Shanghai for three days, but they still haven't been sent.
They don't even answer the phone when they make the delivery.
The courier company said they only have that contact information.
Amazon can't find a place to complain.
I received a text message saying that there was no request for the delay, but the delivery was delayed anyway - this is what I received.
Then they said something about the transfer issue.
Anyway, the terrible shopping experience made me start to doubt the effectiveness of Amazon's logistics system and control system.
